==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 56.67~70.67 seconds<sup>1,700f~2,120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 66.67~80.67 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,420f</sup>.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use anti-Red attackers like [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] to deal with Shy Boys and Area Attackers for the swarm of Snaches. Rinse and repeat until THE SLOTH is dead.

